-# (memory hygiene): rnsd_restart_days=N restarts rnsd every N days at 04:00.
-# N=0 (default) means no crontab entry — crond still runs but has nothing to do.
+# Scheduled tasks: the optional rnsd auto-restart (memory hygiene):
+# rnsd_restart_days=N restarts rnsd every N days at 04:00 (N=0, the default,
+# means no entry), and the daily 05:00 rnsd update check (update_check=yes).
+#
