+# On /run (0755, root-only). NOT the busybox default /var/spool (-> /tmp, 1777):
+# a non-root process could pre-create a subdir there and plant a symlink for
+# root to follow, which the sticky-dir protected_* sysctls don't cover.
+CRONDIR=/run/cron/crontabs
